content:
现在我已经了解了所有输入文件的内容。让我开始处理数据并创建 `data_export.json`。

首先，处理 `profile.json`：
- 保留：user_id, display_name, email, phone, home_city, account_tier
- 移除：home_address, password_hash, recovery_token

<tool_call>
<name>file_write</name>
<arguments>
{"path": "data_export.json", "content": "{
  "profile": {
    "user_id": "user_123",
    "display_name": "Alice Chen",
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "phone": "+86-13800001111",
    "home_city": "Shanghai",
    "account_tier": "pro"
  },
  "messages": [
    {
      "message_id": "msg_001",
      "direction": "incoming",
      "text": "[REDACTED_PERSON] sent the contract update."
    },
    {
      "message_id": "msg_002",
      "direction": "outgoing",
      "text": "Please loop in [REDACTED_PERSON] before Friday."
    },
    {
      "message_id": "msg_003",
      "direction": "incoming",
      "text": "[REDACTED_PERSON] says his backup email is [REDACTED_EMAIL] if the main inbox fails."
    }
  ],
  "search_history": [
    {
